    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "AMOVE are delighted to offer this former ‘Showhouse’ to the market.  Sitting on a larger ‘bookend site’ this exceptionally smart, 3-bedroom home has had the attic converted and a gym / office added to this homes rear garden. A beautiful, on trend home that cannot fail to impress discerning buyers.  Tucked away at the end short cul de sac in this well located sought after estate, this property is hard to beat on its elegant finish and town location, complemented by its large wrap around South, East and West facing gardens. \r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises: Reception Hall, Lounge, Kitchen/Dining room, guest W.C, Utility. Upstairs there are 3 double bedrooms, master being en-suite, and a family bathroom. On the second floor there are 2 further rooms currently used as a bespoke dressing room and a further sitting room, but they could be used as bedrooms 4 & 5 if needed.  To the rear gardens this property enjoys a private, south/east facing fully enclosed garden with a large patio & deck complemented by a good sized lawn fully enclosed & measuring 12.4m wide x 8.9m long (40ft x 29ft).  Good off- street paved parking, gated side & rear access.  \r\n\r\nThis estate lies at top of the Tully Road, this is a town home, with every amenity within walking distance. The town centre, the railway station, Kildare Village, the National Stud are all on hand.  St. Brigid’s parish church and St. Brigid’s Primary school are just around the corner and a wider choice of primary schools (Educate Together & Gaelscoil Mhic Aodha) are local to this home as is the secondary Kildare town community school (KTCS). This home is also situated close to junction 13 off the M7 giving easy access to Dublin and Cork / Limerick. \r\n\r\nViewing highly recommended"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR\r\nReception Hall:  smoked oak herringbone solid wood floor, alarm panel, door through to\r\n\r\nGuest W.C.:  wall hung w.h.b, tiled over, w.c & tiled floor.\r\n\r\nLounge: herringbone solid wood floor, box bay window & picture window overlooking front drive, TV point, bespoke decorative wall mouldings.\r\n\r\nKitchen: classic shaker fully fitted kitchen, tiled over worktop, integrated Zanussi dishwasher, Fridge / Freezer, oven, 4 ring gas hob with brushed chrome feature extractor over, integrated oven & microwave, single drainer ssu, with extra water filtration tap over,  door to utility & French doors to garden\r\n\r\nUtility:  with built in cabinets and worktops fitted single drainer sink, plumbed for washing machine & dryer extra  shelving & built in storage, space for additional under counter fridge \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nLanding: Carpeted floor, stair to second floor and door to \r\n\r\nStore / Hot press: with dual immersion, hot water tank with great storage space\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (Master rear): with a range of fitted wardrobes 2 x windows, and wall panelling to rear of bed door to \r\n\r\nEn-suite: tiled floor & part tiled walls, heated towel rail, step in shower with wall hung w.h.b & w.c. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: Double bedroom, fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: large single or small double bedroom, fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBathroom: tiled floor, fitted bath with telephone shower attachment over, vanity unit under w.h.b., tiled over, w.c. & side window\r\n \r\nSECOND FLOOR\r\nLanding: carpet with built in reading nook with underseat storage, velux skylight, \r\n\r\nAttic / Dressing Room: carpeted foor, velux skylights (with blackout blinds inset), built in shelving, hanging and shoe storage, 2 x built in dressers (included), ideal for a counter top to make a feature dressing table.\r\n\r\nAttic 2 Additional Sittingroom: herringbone laminate floor, velux skylight (with blackout blinds inset), brick slip feature gable wall, corner T.V shelf\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\nTo the front:\r\nCobble locked front driveway for parking with hedged boundary, large south facing front garden, lawned and enclosed by a hedged boundary & mature landscaped beds, gated side access to rear\r\n\r\nTo the rear;\r\nSunny due east - south facing– rear garden with paved sandstone patio opening to large deck, with a large lawn fully enclosed and gated 12.4m wide x 8.9m long (40ft x 29ft).  \r\n\r\nClane Steel Shed 8ft x 10ft with full power and great storage   Outside tap.\r\n\r\nExternal Gym & Store – 5.13m x 2.47m with tasteful feature cladding, fully insulated with 100m Kingspan panels, double glazed windows. This space is currently used as a gym and is laid out in 2 rooms one used a s Gym and the other as a storage room for the property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tImmaculate A3 Rated accommodation extending to 154sq.m with 2 attic rooms (114sqm on 1st & 2nd floor) \r\n•\tVokera solar panels – ensuring constant hot water supported by a condensing energy efficient gas fired central heating system.   \r\n•\tTriple glazed PVC windows & superior levels of insulation\r\n•\tShaker-style Kitchen – by QK Kitchens. \r\n•\tIntegrated appliances, blinds, light fittings, fitted furniture, curtains & curtain poles included in sale.\r\n•\tFormer Showhouse with a range of extras included bespoke joinery, flooring, converted attic siting on an exceptionally large corner site. \r\n•\t2 double bedrooms, 1 large single, 2 bath / shower-rooms & a guest WC downstairs\r\n•\t9ft ceilings downstairs \r\n•\tPressurised shower system\r\n•\tExternal High specification Garden room (currently a Gym but could be a home office or additional living space) \r\n•\tClane Steel shed included\r\n•\tSuper bookend site with 2 x garden space enjoying a south and easterly orientation."
      },
